{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(faster,_similar,_no_long_yap)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (faster, similar, no long yap)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangle with perimeter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c12a6fa7c5930f1b1c0cfa3abe9ffc99a4f236af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$176$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is divided into five congruent rectangles as shown in the diagram.  What is the perimeter of one of the five congruent rectangles?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/337a1fffee9d91efb37d484826230d83c48d36e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)); draw(origin--(0,3)--(4,3)--(4,0)--cycle); draw((0,1)--(4,1)); draw((2,0)--midpoint((0,1)--(4,1))); real r = 4/3; draw((r,3)--foot((r,3),(0,1),(4,1))); draw((2r,3)--foot((2r,3),(0,1),(4,1)));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"188\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/d/3ddd96376f524159dd59929942dc88fb4834fbcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 35.2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }76 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 80 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 84 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" /> represent the length of one of the smaller rectangles, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> represent the width of one of the smaller rectangles, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/b/d0baa33d50c71b1f53694b0f721e1dea61752038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w &lt; l$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>From the large rectangle, we see that the top has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/e/0ce3fe965a1d829cbdd8c35441b11687e90a7ce8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" />, the right has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/8/a68a62eaa7f577508c5ab2eeff22e054cec2aa70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l + w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, the bottom has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/4/1a40f8faeab3899443c5ea0672d4899be44aa7ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />, and the left has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe2e17029c2d732516e290f80e8875f557e97aaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since the perimeter of the large rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c12a6fa7c5930f1b1c0cfa3abe9ffc99a4f236af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$176$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e14a4fcc85c38bb006edde9284f4719c517cabe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$172 = 3w + l + w + 2l + l + w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"238\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee57def9efc9f3ceee037f3c525f9274c1c8bea3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$172 = 5w + 4l$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"110\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>From the top and bottom of the large rectangle, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8fa249079dae4e16d4458341c0fa68efe02964f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3w = 2l$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b38bc338836f625c85ae08fe9da8e4191b282199.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l = 1.5w$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging that into the first equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7ad409bb79034be6b46200e5a8003e0d788aa6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$176 = 5w + 4(1.5)w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07be80500a2e7d351ce20480dd7d60cad134a937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$176 = 11w$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d7e123e0655c8b88f55959038975da7b9a8e2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd61f3f95f00d1fe6b86b5aca41f0ed62fdd7f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l = 1.5w = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/1/6b171cc574f49b784339a9421729724b6266db99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = 2l + 2w = 2(16 + 24) = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"246\" height=\"18\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28faster.2C_similar.2C_no_long_yap.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(faster,_similar,_no_long_yap)\">Solution 2 (faster, similar, no long yap)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (faster, similar, no long yap)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Call the length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and width <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da9f8c7fe0473fdd6f8597eff61d71fedda430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is the width of the big rectangle, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/a/d3aa3c667a7a4f7cb873540543f54630ee8ae500.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y=2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"17\" /> is the length (2 lengths can form the big length, as can 3 widths).Now we have a system of equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/1/081d8031c6c1b4c9d70cf9b6c95882121430a5ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}3y=2x\\\\2(3y+(x+y))=176\\end{matrix}\\right.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"189\" height=\"45\" />\nThis, after simplification, yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016224702\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 206/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2490/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 148/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5085/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.660      1 -total\n 57.92%    7.333      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 40.24%    5.095      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9990:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016224702 and revision id 288027. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}